WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.340
♪The white sail came too late♪

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.340
♪Where did he go?♪

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.820
♪Snow veils the mountains♪

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.340
♪Love endures beyond life and death♪

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.580
♪A black chess piece♪

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:23.140
♪Whose game did he stumble into?♪

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.620
♪All his life, there's no escape♪

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:33.340
♪In ten thousand years, what will still remain?♪

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:40.020
♪Will anyone still love with an unchanging heart?♪

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.620
♪I will remember♪

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.660
♪Those days long past♪

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.580
♪As the wind drifts with the white sail♪

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.660
♪Ten thousand years ago♪

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.500
♪Did you once walk this shore?♪

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:02.940
♪Why can't our bond be severed in this life?♪

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.100
♪I am lost yet willing♪

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:09.580
♪Still I love you with a steadfast heart♪

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:17.100
♪Until all things fade away♪

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:27.220
♪The stars will remember us♪

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.220
[Love & Crown]

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.980
[Adapted from the novel "My Queen" by Xie Lounan]

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.980
[Episode 24]

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.410
You don't like me because of her?

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:37.740
That maid has nothing to do with me.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.570
Please give her the antidote.

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:45.900
Then come out of the palace with me.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.020
We'll go fly a kite,

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:47.770
okay?

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:51.130
Just this once.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.210
Just this once, please?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.460
Fly the kite with me,

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.050
and I'll give you the antidote right away.

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:58.260
I've never lied to you.

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:02.260
Careful!

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:32.570
Your Highness,

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:33.660
forgive me.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.380
Li Hongqing,

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:36.980
I like you like this.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:44.610
Here, Your Highness.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.780
The kite string actually cut your hand.

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:58.340
Let's get rid of it!

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.060
It's just a little scratch.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:17.580
♪Her hairpin sways♪

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.940
♪Thoughts linger on♪

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:24.140
♪Tangled through my long dark hair♪

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:28.500
♪The warmth of your touch...♪

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.580
What are you doing?

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:31.980
Spit helps with the pain.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.370
An old nanny taught me that.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:39.020
Are you cold?

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.780
Why would I be?

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.660
I'm used to it.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:45.780
♪Fate etched deep in every line of my hand...♪

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.490
I don't want your cloak.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:50.220
♪Your eyes hold our garden of bloom...♪

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:51.810
I overstepped.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:57.140
♪Washing the sweetness from the pear petals♪

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:03.100
♪Softly, slowly, round and clear, faint yet near...♪

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:07.250
Your Highness...

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:11.700
♪Drifting, falling, endless and tender♪

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:14.420
♪Through every season, every year, every day...♪

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.250
Why is your heart beating so fast?

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:24.860
♪Softly, slowly, round and clear, faint yet near...♪

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:31.050
Are you ill?

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.580
♪Drifting, falling, endless and tender...♪

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:35.710
No...

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.850
I'm... perfectly fine.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:39.700
Then...

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.810
why are you stuttering?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.540
♪Fills the garden again...♪

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:44.410
I...

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:47.260
♪Moon in my palms♪

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:52.460
♪Rising with the wind on the strings...♪

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.460
I'm hungry.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:58.140
Then...

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.370
I'll take you to get something to eat.

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:09.300
♪Fills the garden again♪

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:15.930
Miss,

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.340
you're so pretty!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:40.660
Just you wait!

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:41.730
I'll call my brother

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.250
to beat you up!

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:44.460
He can't beat me.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:54.930
Kid,

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.580
how about we buy your tanghulu?
[*candied hawthorn]

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.020
I don't want money!

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.990
I just want the tanghulu!

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:13.930
It's so good.

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:16.220
You just wait!

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.180
Don't you run!

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.550
I'll get my brother!

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:20.110
If you've got guts, don't run!

00:07:30.390 --> 00:07:31.170
Your Highness,

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:32.810
let's go.

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.980
He told me to wait here. I can't leave.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.490
When he comes back with his brother,

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:42.020
you can help me knock his brother's teeth out.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.370
Are you upset again?

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.900
Did I do something wrong?

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:14.850
Your Highness,

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:17.900
you can't snatch tanghulu from a child.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.050
I'm a princess.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.250
If I want to eat it,

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.490
why can't I?

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.250
And that maid.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.930
I was never going to accept her sachet anyway.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.490
She didn't do anything wrong.

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:29.980
Why should she have to die for it?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.340
You really wouldn't have taken it?

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.770
That's not the point.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:36.650
I just don't like her.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:47.370
If that makes you unhappy,

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.700
then maybe I can like her too.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:53.700
Does it have anything

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.340
to do with whether I'm happy?

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:58.700
Of course it does.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:00.890
I like you.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.340
I just want you to be happy.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.100
Then do you like me?

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.700
What if I don't?

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.370
Would you tell me to die too?

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:23.770
I wouldn't.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.300
Commander Li can't die.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.180
If you died, I'd be really sad.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:33.100
Sadder than if I died myself.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:46.300
When Your Highness knows

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:48.980
what's right

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:50.700
and what's wrong,

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:53.340
you're actually very lovable.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:57.700
Your Highness,

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:58.460
where are you going?

00:09:58.720 --> 00:09:59.940
To buy tanghulu!

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.770
He just said...

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.420
he only wants the tanghulu,

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.060
not the money!

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:19.580
[Linghe Hall]

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.980
Xiao Huan, you're awake.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:44.340
Cangcang, you're awake too.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:45.370
Princess Ying?

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:51.300
My greetings to you both.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:54.130
What's this about?

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.370
What are you doing here?

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.970
I'm here to ask you for a favor.

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:01.700
What is it?

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.490
Commander Li said

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.660
he has to ask you

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.890
if he's allowed to like me.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.530
You have to say yes.

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:16.980
A dignified, gracious, broad-minded princess

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.100
should come find me at Wuying Hall tomorrow,

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.180
not barge into Linghe Hall at night

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.250
and disturb my sleep.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:24.890
If I have to wait till tomorrow,

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:28.250
I might just die from it.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:29.530
Don't worry.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.180
I'll think it over.

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.390
Not "think it over."

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.770
You have to agree!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:36.900
All right.

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:38.410
I understand.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.260
Go back and get some sleep.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:41.860
Yes!

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:46.810
Then I'll take my leave.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:07.500
I used to hit you and yell at you.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.450
I even poisoned you.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:10.410
That was my fault.

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:14.220
So I'm here to apologize.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:25.170
You're all forgiving me?

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:26.810
- We do! - We do!

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.340
- We do! - We do!

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:30.410
Ying.

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:31.740
Qianqing!

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:35.740
What's going on with them?

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.380
I'm apologizing to them.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.500
They're all happily forgiving me.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.690
They're happy?

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:43.170
- Happy! - Happy!

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:44.740
- So happy! - So happy!

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:45.500
See?

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:47.260
They're really happy.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.380
The sky's clear now.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:53.900
Qianqing,

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.340
come sit in the sun with me!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.260
Come on.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:09.740
Qianqing,

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.140
what is filial piety?

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.340
Is it just

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.450
doing what you're told,

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:17.380
and being there at the very end?

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:20.570
More or less.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.050
Qianqing,

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.810
I'll definitely be there for you in the end.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:36.260
I won't try to kill His Majesty anymore.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.650
Brother Hongqing said

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.650
when Luling Palace was on fire,

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:43.980
His Majesty was still very young

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.340
and in poor health,

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.740
so it wasn't on purpose that he didn't save me.

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:50.620
So I can't blame him.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:52.500
Well, well.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.690
So now you've got a Brother Hongqing besides me.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:13:58.690
Qianqing...

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:02.220
let me tell you a secret.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:03.810
Go on.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:06.020
Yesterday,

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.570
he took me out to have fun.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.770
He told me lots of things.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.340
He said

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.380
he kind of likes me.

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:19.980
If I can be a bit more proper,

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.570
he'll like me even more.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:24.020
So I stayed up all night memorizing two books.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.410
I'll recite them for you, okay?

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:26.340
Okay.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:33.500
"A gentleman does not seek fullness in food

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:35.290
or comfort in living.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.140
He is diligent in action, cautious in speech,

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:42.220
and learns from the virtuous to correct himself.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:44.170
This is...

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:47.620
what it means to love learning."

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.170
What you memorized overnight

00:14:49.190 --> 00:14:50.620
is the Analects of Confucius.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:51.690
And you...

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:52.810
Don't interrupt me,

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.020
or I'll forget it!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:54.980
All right.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:15:01.100
"A gentleman can shoulder great responsibilities..."

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:14.770
Later,

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.450
when Hongqing comes,

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.450
remember to wake me up.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:22.620
Don't worry.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.340
I promise.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.740
You have grown up

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.810
and finally found your own happiness.

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:35.650
I'm happy for you.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:37.930
That's wonderful.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:41.770
Qianqing...

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:48.380
I'll be there for you in the end.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:49.980
All right.

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:52.220
I'll be waiting

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.100
for you to see me off.

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.740
Court's off today and the weather's good.

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:14.570
It's nice to come out for some fresh air.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.020
What a shame this outfit isn't good for archery.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:19.170
Or we'd show those two up in archery.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:21.380
Your Majesty,

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.220
let's settle it at the range today.

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:26.340
If you lose, don't be a sore loser.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.770
You still talk too much.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.570
This is so sour.

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:39.810
How can you eat this?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:41.260
I don't think so.

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:42.340
It's really refreshing.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.260
Tastes great.

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:53.810
You're flirting right in front of us?

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:23.620
Which of them

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:25.380
do you think will win?

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.620
I bet

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:28.580
His Majesty will win!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.620
Good!

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:11.730
That one doesn't count!

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:12.820
I just slipped up.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:13.650
This round doesn't count.

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:16.140
You're still just like before,

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:16.900
can't stand losing.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:18.250
Who's a sore loser?

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.690
You only won once.

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:21.140
If you've got guts, let's go again.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:23.320
Maybe I'll go easy on you

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:24.140
and let you win one.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:25.740
I don't need that.

00:18:27.070 --> 00:18:28.990
Congratulations on your victory.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:30.450
Your Majesty is truly impressive.

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:35.500
Feng Wufu!

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:38.060
You're such a suck-up!

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.340
Your Highness, he just outmatches you.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:43.450
Don't take it out on me, please.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.490
This dagger cuts iron like it's nothing,

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.250
a rare treasure in this world.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.170
Thank you.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:57.650
What are you grinning at?

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.490
Sit down.

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:04.390
They're being all lovey-dovey.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:05.370
What's so great about watching them?

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:07.460
You're only allowed to look at me.

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:09.340
All right.

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:10.650
I'll only look at you.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:12.780
Your Highness is the cutest man in the world,

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:13.300
the most handsome,

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:14.340
and the most fun.

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:15.650
You're the only one in my heart and in my eyes.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:16.410
Satisfied now?

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:42.620
Your Majesty really hides your talents well.

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:43.930
You roast meat

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.580
as well as any master cook in the martial world.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.250
That's because when he was little,

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:50.450
he went through too much hardship.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:54.490
It's all in the past.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.690
No need to bring it up.

00:19:58.190 --> 00:19:58.820
Here.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:04.580
Smells amazing!

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:08.490
Zhong Lin, have a taste.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:14.580
Delicious!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:15.650
So good!

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:19.650
My grilled fish is just as carefully made.

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:21.300
Don't play favorites, okay?

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:22.410
Zhong Lin, here.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:23.410
Have a taste.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:27.620
Cangcang,

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:28.490
after you.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.450
What's wrong, Cangcang?

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:46.860
Nothing.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:48.730
Maybe today's fish...

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:51.170
is a bit fishy.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.010
Let me smell.

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:02.970
It doesn't smell fishy.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:05.860
You usually love fish the most.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.410
Why the change in taste today?

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:08.580
No way.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.620
The fish I grilled could never be fishy.

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:24.580
I told you, I'm fine.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:25.860
Don't get so worked up.

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:28.450
You couple

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:31.340
should really let me worry less!

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:45.490
Physician Li,

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:48.730
is there something wrong with her health?

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:57.340
Your Majesty...

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:00.340
you'd better

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:02.730
get ready.

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:08.690
Get ready?

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:11.340
Get ready for what?

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:21.250
Her Majesty is carrying your child!

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:24.490
Get ready to be a father.

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:31.550
So you mean

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:34.490
she is pregnant?

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:38.340
- Congratulations, Your Majesty! - Congratulations, Your Majesty.

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:41.280
- Congratulations, Her Majesty! - Congratulations, Her Majesty.

00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:43.380
Although in the past,

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:45.740
Her Majesty's health took some damage,

00:22:45.950 --> 00:22:48.950
thankfully her constitution is still very strong,

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:50.300
and

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:51.450
so is yours.

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:53.100
In a moment,

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:55.380
I'll prescribe some medicine to protect the baby.

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:58.540
You must take it regularly

00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:01.900
and must not overwork yourself again.

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:02.690
You two really are trying

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:05.300
to smash my good reputation,

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:06.140
aren't you?

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:09.170
Physician Li,

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:11.100
for these next ten months,

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:13.730
I hope you can stay here in the Capital.

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:14.930
You brat,

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:17.210
now you want to chain me here?

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:18.450
Fine.

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:20.410
From now on, your married life

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:22.100
is my responsibility.

00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:26.860
What are you all standing around for?

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.060
Get out!

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:34.650
Thank you, Physician Li.

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:48.780
Cangcang,

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:50.930
thank you.

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:18.900
I heard you went to Wuying Hall.

00:24:19.840 --> 00:24:21.210
Did His Majesty make things hard for you?

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:23.010
No.

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:26.490
I showed him most of my sincerity.

00:24:27.430 --> 00:24:29.540
Even with all the resentment in his heart,

00:24:30.560 --> 00:24:32.780
we've helped each other after all.

00:24:33.920 --> 00:24:36.860
I figured he'd remember that bond

00:24:38.900 --> 00:24:40.160
and show me some mercy.

00:24:45.160 --> 00:24:45.970
Even if there's trust,

00:24:47.080 --> 00:24:48.140
it's not like before.

00:24:48.160 --> 00:24:49.490
It doesn't have to be!

00:24:52.470 --> 00:24:53.380
In his eyes,

00:24:55.320 --> 00:24:56.650
I never mattered much.

00:25:02.320 --> 00:25:03.100
That's true.

00:25:22.750 --> 00:25:24.380
I know you really

00:25:25.840 --> 00:25:27.930
have my best interests at heart.

00:25:31.080 --> 00:25:31.860
Madam,

00:25:32.920 --> 00:25:34.170
you don't have to force yourself.

00:25:35.560 --> 00:25:37.210
I know you're unhappy today.

00:25:37.680 --> 00:25:39.900
Why would I be unhappy?

00:25:41.950 --> 00:25:42.730
His Majesty...

00:25:43.190 --> 00:25:45.410
finally has an heir.

00:25:45.430 --> 00:25:47.490
We should be happy for him!

00:25:48.990 --> 00:25:52.210
We should be celebrating!

00:25:54.230 --> 00:25:55.490
I just don't understand

00:25:55.750 --> 00:25:57.300
how the Xiao family can live so happily

00:25:57.320 --> 00:25:59.140
after ruining my mother!

00:26:04.800 --> 00:26:05.730
It's not fair!

00:26:22.200 --> 00:26:25.110
Do you like children?

00:26:35.640 --> 00:26:37.410
Or only the one

00:26:38.750 --> 00:26:40.490
she'll give you?

00:26:53.460 --> 00:26:55.100
[Linghe Hall]

00:27:10.750 --> 00:27:11.540
Your Majesty,

00:27:12.160 --> 00:27:13.820
forgive me for the offense.

00:27:14.160 --> 00:27:14.900
Search the place!

00:28:03.800 --> 00:28:04.580
Cangcang,

00:28:05.360 --> 00:28:07.650
can you explain what all this is?

00:28:09.320 --> 00:28:10.820
Why can't you keep the promises

00:28:10.840 --> 00:28:11.690
you made to me?

00:28:12.190 --> 00:28:13.580
I was just reading them.

00:28:14.400 --> 00:28:15.650
I didn't mean anything else.

00:28:16.270 --> 00:28:17.060
Besides,

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:18.820
those street tales,

00:28:19.120 --> 00:28:20.540
sometimes,

00:28:21.080 --> 00:28:21.820
they're...

00:28:23.080 --> 00:28:24.650
not as thrilling as ghost stories.

00:28:26.560 --> 00:28:27.860
Isn't martial arts enough?

00:28:27.880 --> 00:28:28.620
No.

00:28:29.120 --> 00:28:29.930
Not exciting enough.

00:28:42.670 --> 00:28:44.730
Don't be mad.

00:28:47.640 --> 00:28:48.650
Mr. Bai.

00:28:49.710 --> 00:28:50.490
Dear Bai.

00:28:55.270 --> 00:28:56.380
Mr. Bai.

00:28:57.030 --> 00:28:58.170
Dear Bai.

00:28:58.230 --> 00:28:59.410
That won't work on me.

00:28:59.920 --> 00:29:00.690
No, really...

00:29:01.160 --> 00:29:03.410
they're actually quite good.

00:29:05.230 --> 00:29:06.490
Let me show you.

00:29:08.710 --> 00:29:09.780
Just read this one.

00:29:10.950 --> 00:29:13.450
It's the story of Swallow Eight.

00:29:13.640 --> 00:29:15.210
She can catch demons,

00:29:15.320 --> 00:29:16.860
but she's actually a demon herself.

00:29:17.560 --> 00:29:20.060
Later she's killed for drinking too much,

00:29:20.230 --> 00:29:21.820
then she turns into a woman

00:29:22.120 --> 00:29:24.060
and falls for the man who killed her.

00:29:29.710 --> 00:29:30.420
And this one.

00:29:31.840 --> 00:29:33.170
It's really good too.

00:29:33.950 --> 00:29:34.450
Let me show you.

00:29:34.640 --> 00:29:35.250
This one

00:29:35.320 --> 00:29:36.970
[Qiaozhong Monster]
is about a male ghost.

00:29:37.080 --> 00:29:39.210
He always puts a robe

00:29:39.270 --> 00:29:40.580
over the woman he loves

00:29:40.880 --> 00:29:42.620
after she falls asleep.

00:29:42.990 --> 00:29:44.450
It's actually a very heartwarming story.

00:29:47.670 --> 00:29:48.450
Really!

00:29:48.640 --> 00:29:49.410
If you don't believe me,

00:29:50.670 --> 00:29:52.690
you can ask Eunuch Feng.

00:29:55.160 --> 00:29:55.930
Right?

00:29:59.880 --> 00:30:00.650
Yes...

00:30:01.600 --> 00:30:03.060
Ever since Her Majesty

00:30:03.080 --> 00:30:04.900
first told me that story,

00:30:05.230 --> 00:30:07.340
I've been full of energy when helping you

00:30:07.360 --> 00:30:08.540
with memorials,

00:30:08.600 --> 00:30:09.900
not sleepy at all.

00:30:18.360 --> 00:30:19.170
And there

00:30:19.710 --> 00:30:20.970
are even more stories like that.

00:30:20.990 --> 00:30:21.900
All right, Cangcang.

00:30:22.270 --> 00:30:23.060
Earlier,

00:30:23.270 --> 00:30:24.650
I've specially looked up some classics.

00:30:25.360 --> 00:30:27.300
The mother of King Wen of Zhou

00:30:27.320 --> 00:30:28.380
never looked at anything improper

00:30:28.670 --> 00:30:29.930
or listened to anything unpleasant

00:30:29.950 --> 00:30:31.100
when she was pregnant.

00:30:31.510 --> 00:30:33.100
That's what they call prenatal education.

00:30:34.190 --> 00:30:34.970
Prenatal education?

00:30:36.950 --> 00:30:37.650
So...

00:30:37.710 --> 00:30:38.410
So,

00:30:38.840 --> 00:30:41.250
I've specially picked out this book,

00:30:41.750 --> 00:30:43.250
Tales of Rivers and Mountains,

00:30:43.600 --> 00:30:45.410
full of travel notes and insights.

00:30:45.670 --> 00:30:47.100
You can read it properly.

00:30:48.920 --> 00:30:50.540
Come on, sit back down.

00:31:01.080 --> 00:31:01.820
Wufu.

00:31:07.400 --> 00:31:08.210
Here.

00:31:15.840 --> 00:31:16.930
So many words,

00:31:17.600 --> 00:31:18.970
packed so tightly.

00:31:18.970 --> 00:31:19.710
[Tales of Rivers and Mountains]

00:31:19.710 --> 00:31:21.580
How am I supposed to get through this?

00:31:22.840 --> 00:31:23.620
It's all right.

00:31:24.160 --> 00:31:25.060
I can

00:31:25.400 --> 00:31:26.730
read it to you slowly.

00:31:31.560 --> 00:31:32.410
Once we're done,

00:31:32.750 --> 00:31:34.450
you have to eat properly.

00:31:35.360 --> 00:31:36.340
What would you like to eat?

00:31:39.640 --> 00:31:40.410
I...

00:31:40.430 --> 00:31:42.140
Five-spice crispy fish.

00:31:47.710 --> 00:31:48.690
No.

00:31:49.400 --> 00:31:50.410
Smells fishy.

00:31:52.600 --> 00:31:53.380
Next.

00:31:57.510 --> 00:31:59.340
Crystal mutton jelly.

00:32:05.400 --> 00:32:06.170
Next.

00:32:07.190 --> 00:32:08.780
Stuffed eight-treasure duck.

00:32:14.840 --> 00:32:16.340
You don't even want that?

00:32:17.460 --> 00:32:18.450
No.

00:32:18.470 --> 00:32:19.490
I'm not hungry.

00:32:20.640 --> 00:32:21.410
Maybe...

00:32:21.950 --> 00:32:23.300
just don't serve anything.

00:32:24.080 --> 00:32:25.340
Since she has no appetite,

00:32:25.400 --> 00:32:26.300
take it all away.

00:32:26.320 --> 00:32:27.250
Out of the palace,

00:32:27.270 --> 00:32:28.930
I ran around so many restaurants for you.

00:32:28.950 --> 00:32:30.140
My legs nearly broke.

00:32:30.160 --> 00:32:32.060
And she doesn't even want a single dish!

00:32:32.270 --> 00:32:34.540
My reputation's already taken a hit,

00:32:34.600 --> 00:32:36.140
and you clear everything away

00:32:36.160 --> 00:32:37.210
and won't even let me eat?

00:32:37.270 --> 00:32:38.340
She can't handle

00:32:38.470 --> 00:32:39.860
anything greasy.

00:32:40.950 --> 00:32:41.820
Take it all away.

00:32:41.970 --> 00:32:42.900
What a waste.

00:32:43.640 --> 00:32:45.540
Pack it all up and take it to my manor.

00:32:45.710 --> 00:32:47.300
I'll share it with Zhong Lin.

00:32:47.320 --> 00:32:48.140
Okay.

00:32:57.120 --> 00:32:57.970
What are you thinking about?

00:32:58.400 --> 00:32:59.250
I was thinking

00:32:59.640 --> 00:33:01.450
spring will be here in a few days.

00:33:02.190 --> 00:33:02.970
Yes.

00:33:03.470 --> 00:33:04.490
I've already approved

00:33:04.750 --> 00:33:05.820
this year's court assembly.

00:33:07.400 --> 00:33:09.060
So much has happened lately.

00:33:09.670 --> 00:33:10.450
My father

00:33:11.430 --> 00:33:13.300
should have been here by my side,

00:33:14.470 --> 00:33:15.450
but now...

00:33:18.360 --> 00:33:19.140
Cangcang,

00:33:19.800 --> 00:33:20.780
you still have me,

00:33:21.080 --> 00:33:21.860
Zhong Lin,

00:33:21.880 --> 00:33:22.730
Xiao Qianqing,

00:33:23.230 --> 00:33:24.970
and the child we'll have in the future.

00:33:25.750 --> 00:33:26.820
If you miss your father,

00:33:27.120 --> 00:33:28.300
you can visit him.

00:33:29.080 --> 00:33:30.100
If he knows

00:33:30.510 --> 00:33:32.210
we are having a child,

00:33:32.800 --> 00:33:34.060
what will he think?

00:33:46.780 --> 00:33:48.540
[Deer Courtyard]

00:34:07.120 --> 00:34:09.150
When you break through the earth,

00:34:10.950 --> 00:34:13.180
it will be time for great deeds.

00:34:21.820 --> 00:34:24.300
[Linghe Hall]

00:34:24.360 --> 00:34:25.130
Your Majesty.

00:34:25.280 --> 00:34:26.220
His Majesty had the kitchens

00:34:26.240 --> 00:34:28.340
prepare this bird's nest soup.

00:34:28.430 --> 00:34:29.260
He told me

00:34:29.280 --> 00:34:30.820
to make sure you taste it.

00:34:56.360 --> 00:34:57.180
Eunuch Feng?

00:34:57.590 --> 00:34:59.220
Peace to Your Majesty.

00:35:00.630 --> 00:35:01.660
What brings you here?

00:35:01.990 --> 00:35:02.860
Where is His Majesty?

00:35:02.990 --> 00:35:04.180
Your Majesty,

00:35:04.200 --> 00:35:06.490
His Majesty is busy in Wuying Hall.

00:35:06.630 --> 00:35:07.530
He sent me

00:35:07.990 --> 00:35:10.300
to change out Your Majesty's incense.

00:35:10.550 --> 00:35:11.380
Change the incense?

00:35:12.590 --> 00:35:14.050
The one I have is perfectly fine.

00:35:14.240 --> 00:35:15.220
Why change it?

00:35:15.510 --> 00:35:16.860
His Majesty said

00:35:17.110 --> 00:35:21.380
the old incense was for clearing the head

00:35:21.400 --> 00:35:22.260
and wasn't the best for you now.

00:35:22.470 --> 00:35:25.530
So he wants this gentler blend instead,

00:35:25.550 --> 00:35:28.820
to keep Your Majesty relaxed every day.

00:35:29.880 --> 00:35:30.660
Very well.

00:35:33.590 --> 00:35:34.380
All right.

00:35:37.550 --> 00:35:38.340
Xiaoshan,

00:35:38.550 --> 00:35:39.860
go bring me my sword.

00:35:39.880 --> 00:35:41.180
I'm in the mood today.

00:35:41.680 --> 00:35:42.570
No!

00:35:42.880 --> 00:35:43.740
Your Majesty,

00:35:44.070 --> 00:35:46.260
you're not well right now.

00:35:46.470 --> 00:35:47.700
You mustn't practice swordplay.

00:35:47.920 --> 00:35:48.900
I can't do this either?

00:35:53.590 --> 00:35:56.050
I was once the proud leader of Fenglai Pavilion,

00:35:56.320 --> 00:35:57.130
and now

00:35:57.320 --> 00:35:59.450
I've become some pampered hothouse flower?

00:36:00.590 --> 00:36:01.380
Forget it.

00:36:02.760 --> 00:36:03.700
Your Majesty, where are you going?

00:36:03.720 --> 00:36:05.180
His Majesty said you mustn't run around.

00:36:06.990 --> 00:36:08.490
I'm going to find him, all right?

00:36:11.320 --> 00:36:12.090
Your Majesty...

00:36:19.400 --> 00:36:20.180
Your Majesty.

00:36:22.630 --> 00:36:23.410
Cangcang!

00:36:29.280 --> 00:36:30.220
What brings you here?

00:36:30.630 --> 00:36:32.090
I'm here to take you back.

00:36:32.680 --> 00:36:34.410
Xiaoshan watches me all day,

00:36:34.680 --> 00:36:35.490
saying you told her

00:36:35.510 --> 00:36:36.570
I can't do this

00:36:36.590 --> 00:36:37.820
and I can't do that.

00:36:38.400 --> 00:36:40.090
I'm about to turn into a complete invalid.

00:36:42.630 --> 00:36:44.490
I wouldn't even mind being useless,

00:36:44.510 --> 00:36:45.340
but...

00:36:45.880 --> 00:36:48.340
could you at least not take away my freedom?

00:36:49.720 --> 00:36:50.490
Cangcang,

00:36:51.110 --> 00:36:52.410
it's all for your own good.

00:36:52.990 --> 00:36:54.610
Once Physician Li says you can move around,

00:36:54.630 --> 00:36:55.970
you'll have more freedom.

00:36:57.720 --> 00:36:58.490
All right.

00:36:59.920 --> 00:37:01.900
Then until Physician Li nods,

00:37:02.630 --> 00:37:03.780
I promise

00:37:04.110 --> 00:37:05.180
I'll behave myself.

00:37:05.800 --> 00:37:06.570
Good.

00:37:06.880 --> 00:37:07.570
Come on.

00:37:07.590 --> 00:37:08.860
Let's go back to Linghe Hall.

00:37:08.950 --> 00:37:09.740
Let's go.

00:37:20.800 --> 00:37:21.410
Wufu.

00:37:21.430 --> 00:37:22.050
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:37:22.070 --> 00:37:24.410
Double-check everything the Empress eats or uses.

00:37:24.430 --> 00:37:25.550
No errors are allowed.

00:37:25.550 --> 00:37:26.100
Understood.

00:37:28.470 --> 00:37:30.660
You'll personally keep watch over the guards at Linghe Hall.

00:37:30.680 --> 00:37:31.340
Understood.

00:37:32.880 --> 00:37:33.660
Your Majesty,

00:37:34.550 --> 00:37:36.260
isn't this a bit much?

00:37:43.760 --> 00:37:44.900
But don't worry.

00:37:44.950 --> 00:37:46.930
I'll keep an eye on my mother.

00:37:46.950 --> 00:37:48.860
We'll see your heir safely born.

00:37:49.990 --> 00:37:50.780
All right.

00:37:52.280 --> 00:37:53.530
How are things at Deer Courtyard?

00:37:54.150 --> 00:37:55.300
Your father-in-law works the fields there every day.

00:37:55.510 --> 00:37:57.300
He caught a slight chill recently and has been coughing.

00:37:57.720 --> 00:37:58.930
The imperial physicians have seen him.

00:37:58.950 --> 00:37:59.740
Aside from that,

00:37:59.840 --> 00:38:00.700
nothing unusual.

00:38:01.550 --> 00:38:02.780
Make sure he's well taken care of.

00:38:03.360 --> 00:38:04.130
After all,

00:38:04.550 --> 00:38:05.490
he's getting old.

00:38:06.240 --> 00:38:07.050
Understood.

00:38:08.680 --> 00:38:10.050
Add some coltsfoot blossoms.

00:38:10.680 --> 00:38:12.930
They're very good for easing the cough.

00:38:16.510 --> 00:38:17.300
Here, Madam.

00:38:27.590 --> 00:38:29.050
"Shi Yan will launch a surprise attack

00:38:29.070 --> 00:38:31.930
on Lingbi Sect's Langye Mountain branch in two days."

00:38:35.720 --> 00:38:37.450
Leak this news to Lingbi Sect.

00:38:40.070 --> 00:38:42.050
But won't that put Shi Yan in danger?

00:38:42.070 --> 00:38:43.490
If something happens to Shi Yan,

00:38:43.920 --> 00:38:45.780
what will Li Hongqing do?

00:38:47.840 --> 00:38:49.340
With the commander of the Imperial Guards away,

00:38:50.920 --> 00:38:52.860
you, the deputy commander,

00:38:53.070 --> 00:38:54.410
can serve a greater purpose.

00:38:59.920 --> 00:39:00.450
Understood.

00:39:00.950 --> 00:39:02.610
That mad princess in the palace

00:39:02.950 --> 00:39:04.050
is still

00:39:04.920 --> 00:39:07.130
a clever move we haven't even played.

00:39:33.550 --> 00:39:34.340
Saintess.

00:39:34.680 --> 00:39:35.900
I have received word

00:39:36.070 --> 00:39:37.220
that the Emperor's Xiaoxing Guards

00:39:37.240 --> 00:39:39.300
plans to strike Lingbi Sect's Langye Mountain branch.

00:39:47.340 --> 00:39:49.820
[Saintess, Lingbi Sect]

00:39:56.320 --> 00:39:57.260
Is the report accurate?

00:39:57.920 --> 00:39:58.700
Yes.

00:39:59.400 --> 00:40:01.260
Shi Yan meant to strike straight at the heart

00:40:01.550 --> 00:40:03.700
and take the Langye Mountain branch in one blow.

00:40:04.070 --> 00:40:05.300
But he walked into an ambush.

00:40:07.150 --> 00:40:08.450
Though the Ghost King is dead

00:40:09.200 --> 00:40:10.740
and they're now headless,

00:40:10.950 --> 00:40:12.700
they've been in the martial world for years

00:40:12.950 --> 00:40:14.220
and are hard to wipe out completely.

00:40:14.840 --> 00:40:16.820
Earlier, Zhu Sha mentioned the Saintess,

00:40:17.240 --> 00:40:18.900
saying she's their true master.

00:40:20.680 --> 00:40:21.860
I request permission to set out

00:40:21.990 --> 00:40:22.930
to bring Shi Yan back

00:40:22.990 --> 00:40:25.130
and uncover the truth for Your Majesty.

00:40:26.150 --> 00:40:26.740
All right.

00:40:27.320 --> 00:40:28.340
Then be careful.

00:40:35.590 --> 00:40:36.380
Commander Li.

00:40:41.070 --> 00:40:42.090
What did you need from me?

00:40:42.200 --> 00:40:43.340
I'm leaving on urgent business.

00:40:43.430 --> 00:40:45.380
The palace patrols and His Majesty's safety

00:40:45.400 --> 00:40:46.180
will be in your hands.

00:40:46.200 --> 00:40:47.130
We're buddies.

00:40:47.200 --> 00:40:48.380
No need to be so formal.

00:40:48.840 --> 00:40:49.610
Besides,

00:40:49.760 --> 00:40:51.530
this is all part of my duty.

00:40:52.680 --> 00:40:53.450
Also,

00:40:53.630 --> 00:40:54.490
over at the cold palace,

00:40:54.920 --> 00:40:56.340
no more than three lamps are allowed.

00:40:56.470 --> 00:40:57.970
All lamps must be out by the hour of Xu.

00:40:58.150 --> 00:40:59.450
Though that's the servants' task,

00:40:59.680 --> 00:41:00.970
have the men keep an eye on it too.

00:41:01.070 --> 00:41:02.380
Ask them to help watch it.

00:41:03.680 --> 00:41:04.450
Three lamps.

00:41:04.550 --> 00:41:05.340
Hour of Xu.

00:41:05.400 --> 00:41:06.180
No problem.

00:41:06.720 --> 00:41:07.490
Thank you.

00:41:07.920 --> 00:41:08.700
Oh, yes.

00:41:09.400 --> 00:41:10.530
You know

00:41:10.630 --> 00:41:11.700
what the princess is like.

00:41:12.150 --> 00:41:13.660
I'm afraid the guys won't handle her well

00:41:14.150 --> 00:41:15.340
and make her unhappy.

00:41:16.320 --> 00:41:17.050
It's fine.

00:41:17.920 --> 00:41:18.930
Just coax her and say

00:41:19.720 --> 00:41:20.970
as long as she doesn't get mad

00:41:21.280 --> 00:41:22.130
or hit anyone,

00:41:22.880 --> 00:41:24.220
the flower will bloom soon.

00:42:04.630 --> 00:42:05.860
What kind of flower is it?

00:42:08.110 --> 00:42:09.570
Honestly, I'm not quite sure.

00:42:10.550 --> 00:42:11.740
But once it blooms,

00:42:12.110 --> 00:42:13.340
we'll know.

00:42:18.320 --> 00:42:20.130
I'll take good care of it.

00:42:20.200 --> 00:42:24.130
I'll make sure it grows up well and blossoms.

00:42:24.720 --> 00:42:26.450
Then we can see what it looks like together.

00:42:46.470 --> 00:42:48.970
I'm not eating until Hongqing comes back.

00:42:49.550 --> 00:42:50.570
Your Highness,

00:42:50.720 --> 00:42:52.820
Commander Li will be gone for quite a few days.

00:42:52.920 --> 00:42:54.220
You'll ruin your health if you starve.

00:42:54.320 --> 00:42:55.340
We can't have that.

00:42:59.360 --> 00:43:00.180
All right then.

00:43:00.760 --> 00:43:02.450
I should be more understanding.

00:43:04.510 --> 00:43:05.300
Then,

00:43:05.920 --> 00:43:07.780
I'll eat ten bites today,

00:43:08.110 --> 00:43:09.660
nine bites tomorrow...

00:43:10.590 --> 00:43:12.610
If he still isn't back in ten days,

00:43:13.430 --> 00:43:14.930
I won't eat a single bite!

00:43:15.680 --> 00:43:16.570
Your Highness,

00:43:16.590 --> 00:43:17.260
this...

00:43:17.280 --> 00:43:18.860
this absolutely won't do!

00:43:18.950 --> 00:43:20.130
Let me talk to Her Highness.

00:43:24.760 --> 00:43:25.610
Get out.

00:43:27.990 --> 00:43:28.930
I don't like you.

00:43:46.820 --> 00:43:51.660
♪Who walks lone through storm and snow♪

00:43:52.580 --> 00:43:55.740
♪Reading every warmth and chill♪

00:43:56.700 --> 00:43:59.500
♪Of the heart?♪

00:44:01.460 --> 00:44:05.660
♪Who stands proud against a thousand weights♪

00:44:06.420 --> 00:44:09.860
♪Grace only a mask he wears?♪

00:44:10.100 --> 00:44:13.180
♪My blade sweeps the heavens♪

00:44:14.100 --> 00:44:16.620
♪Blood once drenched♪

00:44:17.380 --> 00:44:20.100
♪My armor and charging steed♪

00:44:20.780 --> 00:44:22.980
♪I know what it means to let go♪

00:44:23.900 --> 00:44:27.300
♪When to step in, when to hold back♪

00:44:27.740 --> 00:44:30.860
♪A broken blade cuts through♪

00:44:31.260 --> 00:44:34.020
♪Years of winter and summer♪

00:44:34.900 --> 00:44:36.940
♪Enemy flags burn to ash like gauze♪

00:44:37.780 --> 00:44:42.980
♪Yet my heart still bears the scars of rise and fall♪

00:44:43.140 --> 00:44:49.100
♪I'm willing to wield my sword with you and burn the waning moon♪

00:44:50.380 --> 00:44:56.260
♪I'm willing to brave all storms with you, boiling with passion♪

00:44:57.060 --> 00:45:03.220
♪I'm willing to break my wings and become the blade in your hand♪

00:45:04.020 --> 00:45:10.220
♪I'm willing to write with you this torn, enduring page of history♪

00:45:11.140 --> 00:45:16.940
♪I'm willing to travel thousands of miles, seeking your ambition♪

00:45:18.180 --> 00:45:24.140
♪I'm willing to give my life to keep you safe for a lifetime♪

00:45:24.980 --> 00:45:31.500
♪I'm willing to sing through every farewell and wait for you another thousand years♪

00:45:31.940 --> 00:45:39.380
♪I'm willing to live and die with you, my one and only wish in this lifetime♪